      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Every three hits from Akshan's Attacks and Abilities deals bonus damage and grants him a Shield if the target was a champion. When Akshan Attacks, he fires an additional Attack for reduced damage. If he cancels the additional Attack, he instead gains Move Speed.",
      "summary_zh": "来自阿克尚攻击或技能的每第三次命中会造成额外伤害，并且如果目标是英雄还会为他提供一层护盾。 在阿克尚攻击时，他会进行一次额外的射击，来造成较少伤害。如果他取消掉了这次额外射击，那么他会转而获得移动速度。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1502461:4038197"
      ]
    },
