      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Akshan fires a grappling hook into terrain then swings around it, repeatedly firing at the nearest enemy while swinging. He can jump off early or gets knocked off when colliding with champions or terrain.",
      "summary_zh": "阿克尚发射一个钩爪来吸附住地形，然后围绕它进行摆荡，在摆荡时快速朝相距最近的敌人开火。他可以提前从绳索上荡下来，或在与一名敌方英雄或地形产生碰撞时落下。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1502464:4007412"
      ]
    },
    {
